<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Swiss RE buy of Italy's Uniorias.</title>
<headline>EU clears Swiss RE buy of Italy's Uniorias.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Monday it had cleared the acquisition of Italian reinsurer Uniorias by Swiss Re.</p>
<p>Swiss Re signed a deal to purchase Unione di Riassicurazione SpA last month, saying it would buy it from Instituto Nazionale delle Assicurazoni SpA (INA) for an expected price of 500 million Swiss francs ($350.1 million).</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11 ($ = 1.428 Swiss Francs)</p>
